{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415707","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415707","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041570701:0":{"text":"おやまあ、ここでご先祖様に会えるなんて、長生きはするものですねぇ！","source_cn":"没想到会在这里见到先祖，真是奇妙的缘分啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166FEB8839655BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570702:0":{"text":"確かあなたは、ティ……ああ、そうそう、ティラヤ賢者でございますね？","source_cn":"要是我没记错的话，你是缇……哦，想起来了，缇洛亚贤者，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D40FE553A9F0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570703:0":{"text":"えっ、先祖？ウチが！？ひ、人違いじゃないか？","source_cn":"等等！我……？先祖？！你、你认错人了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214D5326C7F2A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570704:0":{"text":"ほっほっほ、まさか、まだそこまで耄碌しちゃおりませんよ。","source_cn":"不不不，我还没到老眼昏花的年纪，不会认错人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204AF365F934873B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570705:0":{"text":"巻物に描かれた姿よりもだいぶお若いですが……その美しい鹿角を見て、すぐにあなただと分かりました。","source_cn":"虽然你看上去比记史卷轴绘制的模样年轻不少，但我一眼就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x774845992AB16F5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","